BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 193.5 Td (Disable Large Send Offload \(LSO\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 172.0 Td (LSO lets the network adapter combine packets into larger) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 157.5 Td (batches. That can help throughput, but it can also create short) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 143.0 Td (ping spikes in games. Turning it off is one of the best low-risk) Tj ET
