BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 253.0 Td (This keeps more Wi-Fi antenna chains active. It can help) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 238.5 Td (throughput, but it is not the first setting to use for jitter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 224.0 Td (Keep it off first.) Tj ET
